OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine and
OL,6,Fdry evening. Clear spells overnight
OL,7,Fwith mist and isolated fog patches
OL,8,Fdeveloping for a time. Cloud builds
OL,9,Fthrough the night to leave a cloudy
OL,10,Fstart to Tuesday. A further cool night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy to start with patchy
OL,13,Flight rain from mid-morning and some
OL,14,Fcoastal fog. Clearer briefly overnight
OL,15,Fbut with rain arriving by dawn. Near
OL,16,Faverage daytime temperatures, mild
OL,17,Fovernight. Strengthening winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
